{"seq":2,"slug":"buddy-system","title":"伙伴系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/classic/buddy-system","wordCount":1849,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"伙伴系统\">伙伴系统</h1><p>伙伴系统的全部聪明，都来自一个看似武断的约束：所有块的大小都必须是二的幂。一旦接受这条规则，分裂与合并就从需要遍历链表、读边界标记的麻烦事，退化成几次位运算——找伙伴、判空闲、合并，全在常数时间内完成。这种把空间利用率主动让出一部分、换取近乎免费的分裂合并的取舍，让伙伴系统至今仍坐镇 Linux 内核的页分配器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>伙伴系统把一整块大内存（大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）按二的幂层层对半切分。当请求一块大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的内存时，分配器从恰好够大的层级找空闲块；若没有，就到更高一层取一个块，对半劈开，一半备用、另一半继续往下劈，直到得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。每次劈出的两半互为「伙伴」——它们大小相同、地址相邻，且只差一个特定的二进制位。释放时，分配器检查伙伴是否也空闲，若是就立即合并回上一层，如此递归向上。</p>\n<p>伙伴地址的计算是整套系统的灵魂。一个大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、起始地址为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 的块，它的伙伴地址是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>buddy</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>⊕</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{buddy}(a, k) = a \\oplus 2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buddy</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>一次异或就找到伙伴，这正是二的幂约束换来的回报——无需任何额外指针或边界标记。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  T[1024KB 整块] --&gt; S1[请求 70KB&lt;br/&gt;向上取整到 128KB = 2^7]&#10;  S1 --&gt; A[劈 1024 -&gt; 512+512]&#10;  A --&gt; B[劈 512 -&gt; 256+256]&#10;  B --&gt; C[劈 256 -&gt; 128+128]&#10;  C --&gt; D[取一个 128KB 块返回&lt;br/&gt;另一 128KB 留作伙伴]&#10;  D --&gt; E[释放时检查伙伴 128KB]&#10;  E --&gt; F{伙伴空闲?}&#10;  F -- 是 --&gt; G[异或求伙伴地址 合并回 256KB]&#10;  F -- 否 --&gt; H[留在 128KB 空闲链]\">flowchart TD\n  T[1024KB 整块] --&gt; S1[请求 70KB&lt;br/&gt;向上取整到 128KB = 2^7]\n  S1 --&gt; A[劈 1024 -&gt; 512+512]\n  A --&gt; B[劈 512 -&gt; 256+256]\n  B --&gt; C[劈 256 -&gt; 128+128]\n  C --&gt; D[取一个 128KB 块返回&lt;br/&gt;另一 128KB 留作伙伴]\n  D --&gt; E[释放时检查伙伴 128KB]\n  E --&gt; F{伙伴空闲?}\n  F -- 是 --&gt; G[异或求伙伴地址 合并回 256KB]\n  F -- 否 --&gt; H[留在 128KB 空闲链]</pre><h2 id=\"分裂与合并-为什么是常数时间\">分裂与合并：为什么是常数时间</h2><p>伙伴系统为每个二的幂层级维护一条独立的空闲链。请求大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 时，先向上取整到最近的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k = \\lceil \\log_2 s \\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>），然后看第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层链表：有块就直接摘走；没有就向上层借，借到一个块后对半分裂，把多出的一半挂到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层链。整个分裂过程最多走 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层，与堆总大小的对数成正比，实际中是个很小的常数。</p>\n<p>合并更漂亮。释放一个第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层的块时，用异或算出它伙伴的地址，直接查那条链看伙伴在不在、是否同样空闲、是否同为第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 层（未被进一步分裂）。三个条件都满足就把两者从链上摘下、拼成第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 层的块，再对新块递归尝试合并。这个过程不需要 <a href=\"free-lists\">空闲链表</a> 里那套边界标记扫描，因为伙伴关系由地址和大小唯一确定。</p>\n<p>这正是伙伴系统对外部碎片的强力压制：任何相邻的、对齐的空闲对都会被迅速合并回去，空闲空间很难退化成无法利用的零碎蜂窝。外部碎片的概念见 <a href=\"fragmentation\">碎片化</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代价-内部碎片与二的幂之痛\">代价：内部碎片与二的幂之痛</h2><p>天下没有免费的合并。伙伴系统把外部碎片压到极低，账单转嫁到了内部碎片上。因为所有分配都向上取整到二的幂，最坏情况极其难看：请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^k + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9324em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 字节，会被分配一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{k+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 字节的块，几乎一半被浪费。平均而言，随机大小请求在伙伴系统下的内部碎片约为 25%——这是它为简洁与速度付出的固定代价。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>伙伴系统表现</th>\n<th>与空闲链表对比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>分裂耗时</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，实为小常数</td>\n<td>链表需遍历查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并耗时</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，异或定位伙伴</td>\n<td>链表需边界标记扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部碎片</td>\n<td>很低，相邻对快速合并</td>\n<td>通用链表下可能严重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部碎片</td>\n<td>高，平均约 25%</td>\n<td>链表可按需精确分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数据</td>\n<td>极简（每层一条链 + 位图）</td>\n<td>每块头部 + footer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>为缓解内部碎片，工程上常把伙伴系统与上层细分配器叠用：伙伴系统只负责大块（页级），细粒度的小对象分配交给坐在它之上的 Slab，由 Slab 把一整页再切成许多同尺寸小对象，从而摊掉二的幂带来的浪费。这正是 <a href=\"slab-allocation\">Slab 分配</a> 与伙伴系统的经典分工。</p>\n<p>把伙伴系统的分裂与空闲链表的通用分配放在同一把尺子上，取舍一目了然：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>伙伴系统的答案</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>块大小约束</td>\n<td>强制为二的幂</td>\n<td>内部碎片，平均约 25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>伙伴定位</td>\n<td>一次异或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊕</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\oplus 2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>仅对同源分裂出的对齐块成立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>合并触发</td>\n<td>释放时立即合并，递归向上</td>\n<td>释放路径稍长，但仍是常数级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数据位置</td>\n<td>每层一条空闲链 + 位图</td>\n<td>不随块数增长，极其轻量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务对象</td>\n<td>大块、需物理连续的页级分配</td>\n<td>不适合微小、精确尺寸的请求</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li>这张表也解释了为什么伙伴系统「不适合当通用 <code>malloc</code>」：二的幂约束在页级可接受（浪费的是页的一部分），在小对象级则代价过高（浪费接近一半）。</li>\n<li>反模式：把伙伴系统直接拿来分配小对象、或在不保证对齐的地址上套用异或求伙伴——前者碎片爆炸，后者会算错伙伴甚至破坏合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"在-linux-内核里的真实角色\">在 Linux 内核里的真实角色</h2><p>伙伴系统不是教科书里的玩具，它是 Linux 内核页分配器的实际算法。内核以 4KiB 页为基本单位，按二的幂管理「order」——order-0 是 1 页、order-1 是 2 页、依此类推到 order-10（1024 页，4MiB）。每个 order 维护一条空闲页块链，分配大块物理连续内存时正是走伙伴算法分裂、释放时异或求伙伴合并。</p>\n<p>之所以选伙伴系统，是因为内核对页分配有两个硬需求：物理连续（DMA、大页都要）和快速（在中断上下文也可能调用）。伙伴系统恰好同时满足——二的幂保证了对齐与连续，对数级操作保证了速度。但内核同样深知它的内部碎片软肋，所以频繁的小对象分配（<code>task_struct</code>、<code>inode</code>、<code>dentry</code> 等）并不直接找伙伴系统，而是经由 SLUB 这类 Slab 分配器，后者向伙伴系统批发整页、再零售给同类小对象。这条「伙伴系统批发、Slab 零售」的两级结构，是理解内核内存管理的关键，详见 <a href=\"slab-allocation\">Slab 分配</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>伙伴系统强制块大小为二的幂，用一次异或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>⊕</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a \\oplus 2^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⊕</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 即可定位伙伴，使分裂与合并都降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的小常数。</li>\n<li>它对每个二的幂层级维护独立空闲链，请求向上取整后从对应层取块、不足则向上借并分裂。</li>\n<li>强项是外部碎片极低（相邻对快速合并）、元数据极简；软肋是内部碎片高，平均约 25%。</li>\n<li>它是 Linux 内核页分配器的实际算法，按 order 管理物理连续页，满足内核对连续与速度的硬需求。</li>\n<li>内部碎片靠与上层 Slab 叠用缓解：伙伴系统批发整页、Slab 零售同类小对象，见 <a href=\"slab-allocation\">Slab 分配</a>。</li>\n<li>它换来的是确定性：分裂与合并都是常数级位运算，不改动已有块的地址——这正是 DMA、大页等需要物理连续与可预测延迟的场景最看重的性质。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"伙伴系统","id":"伙伴系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分裂与合并：为什么是常数时间","id":"分裂与合并-为什么是常数时间"},{"level":2,"text":"代价：内部碎片与二的幂之痛","id":"代价-内部碎片与二的幂之痛"},{"level":2,"text":"在 Linux 内核里的真实角色","id":"在-linux-内核里的真实角色"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"空闲链表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/classic/free-lists"},"next":{"title":"Slab 分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/memory-allocator-design/classic/slab-allocation"}}